<title>FRANCE: UAP sees significant profit rise in 1997.</title>
<headline>UAP sees significant profit rise in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance group UAP hopes for a significant profit rise in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Given our restructuring progamme...we are hoping for a significant profit rise in 1997,&quot; chairman Jacques Friedmann told a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
